<h2 id="routing" class="doc-section text-3xl pt-8 pb-3 border-b border-terminal-dim">Command Routing</h2>

<p class="text-xl pt-4 pb-3">
  Commands are routed to handlers with these priority rules:
</p>

<div class="text-xl space-y-3 pt-2">
  <div class="border-l-2 border-terminal-bright pl-4">
    <div class="text-terminal-bright">1. Pending Roll (highest priority)</div>
    <p class="pt-1">If a dice roll is pending, <strong>only</strong> the <code>roll</code> command is accepted. Everything else is rejected.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="border-l-2 border-terminal-bright pl-4">
    <div class="text-terminal-bright">2. Active Combat</div>
    <p class="pt-1">If in combat, only combat commands are accepted: <code>attack</code>, <code>defend</code>, <code>flee</code>, <code>use</code>, <code>inventory</code>, <code>examine</code>, <code>look</code>.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="border-l-2 border-terminal-bright pl-4">
    <div class="text-terminal-bright">3. Normal Routing</div>
    <p class="pt-1">Commands route to their appropriate handler based on verb.</p>
  </div>
</div>

